WEBVTT

00:06.006 --> 00:08.508
[opening theme music playing]

00:35.035 --> 00:36.244
[ominous music playing]

00:36.327 --> 00:37.746
[Jang Uk] Why are you following me?

00:38.747 --> 00:39.706
Who are you?

00:41.875 --> 00:43.168
Tell me.

01:03.229 --> 01:04.856
If you know what this sword is,

01:05.607 --> 01:06.816
you must be a mage.

01:09.402 --> 01:10.820
Lower your blade now.

01:13.406 --> 01:16.910
It's dangerous to draw the sword
of Cheonbugwan here recklessly like this.

01:19.913 --> 01:21.956
Because we are in Gaema Village.

01:23.041 --> 01:26.127
A mage arresting those
who practice sorcery is an enemy.

01:28.046 --> 01:31.508
If someone finds out that you came
all the way here and got into a fight,

01:32.634 --> 01:34.677
it will spell trouble for you.

01:42.560 --> 01:43.686
It seems that…

01:44.687 --> 01:46.439
you must already know who I am.

01:48.525 --> 01:50.610
With the sword
of the Gwanju of Cheonbugwan,

01:52.529 --> 01:53.863
you must be his son.

02:00.995 --> 02:04.332
[Dang-gu] Does Uk not know
what his father looks like?

02:04.833 --> 02:06.668
[somber music playing]

02:06.751 --> 02:10.421
Just like his mother right there,
has he ever even seen his portrait?

02:10.505 --> 02:12.882
We do not have any portraits
of the Gwanju in the house.

02:13.842 --> 02:15.802
And he never looked for one anywhere else.

02:17.095 --> 02:19.973
I doubt he remembers a few times
he saw him when he was little.

02:21.141 --> 02:22.809
Even if he ran into his father,

02:23.434 --> 02:25.103
he would ask, "Who are you?"

02:28.648 --> 02:31.401
[Gang] I only followed you
because I recognized that sword.

02:36.156 --> 02:37.907
Do you know who the owner of the sword is?

02:40.493 --> 02:43.246
Isn't the one who abandoned that sword
a madman?

02:44.873 --> 02:46.833
His wife had an affair and died.

02:48.126 --> 02:51.129
And then, he abandoned his own son
and his title and ran away.

02:53.047 --> 02:54.966
The madman, Jang Gang.

02:55.049 --> 02:56.092
[scoffs]

02:59.012 --> 03:00.805
People have whispered behind my back,

03:01.598 --> 03:03.766
but no one has said these things
in front of me.

03:05.059 --> 03:06.895
Do you bear some grudge against my father?

03:09.731 --> 03:10.857
If I do…

03:11.941 --> 03:14.903
will you seek revenge on his behalf
because you are his son?

03:19.073 --> 03:20.366
I will not.

03:20.450 --> 03:22.619
It would be ridiculous for me to do that.

03:23.536 --> 03:24.954
And I do not think he would want it.

03:27.165 --> 03:30.043
If that is how you think, then why are you
carrying your father's sword?

03:30.126 --> 03:32.170
Because if I insist
that I'm not his actual son,

03:33.087 --> 03:34.213
what would become…

03:35.089 --> 03:36.674
of my poor dear mother?

03:40.762 --> 03:41.888
Do-hwa.

03:45.600 --> 03:48.061
Do-hwa is the most unfortunate.

03:49.479 --> 03:51.689
[somber music playing]

03:57.904 --> 03:59.447
Do you know my mother too?

04:01.658 --> 04:05.245
[Gang] Do-hwa was the most
beautiful woman in all of Daeho.

04:06.996 --> 04:09.999
And there was no one in Daeho
who did not know about her.

04:10.583 --> 04:13.920
So it seems like almost everyone
in the family is famous.

04:15.296 --> 04:16.673
But still,

04:16.756 --> 04:20.635
I did not expect to meet someone
who would recognize me at a glance here.

04:48.371 --> 04:52.750
This is a place where sorcery prohibited
by Songrim is practiced in secret.

04:53.418 --> 04:57.213
What is the son of Jang Gang
doing wandering about here?

04:57.297 --> 05:00.508
Well, I heard that you could see
all sorts of sorcery here,

05:00.591 --> 05:02.010
such as curses and soul magic.

05:02.093 --> 05:03.803
A mage from Jeongjingak

05:04.345 --> 05:06.347
is trying to see such sorcery?

05:07.640 --> 05:08.725
It is not like that.

05:09.809 --> 05:12.437
I am here to find a shaman
who practiced such sorcery.

05:14.439 --> 05:15.523
A shaman?

05:16.399 --> 05:19.027
I'm looking for a shaman
who was once skilled in soul magic,

05:19.610 --> 05:21.571
which drives people mad
by possessing them.

05:23.573 --> 05:25.116
I heard 20 years ago,

05:25.199 --> 05:27.035
they fled after being caught
by Cheonbugwan

05:27.118 --> 05:28.953
and their entire house was burned down.

05:30.997 --> 05:32.874
You wanna meet the shaman
of the Choi family?

05:33.374 --> 05:35.460
So you already know which shaman it was?

05:37.920 --> 05:41.758
By chance, are you a mage from Cheonbugwan
who used to work

05:42.258 --> 05:43.593
under my father back then?

05:46.012 --> 05:48.097
The Chois are a mage family

05:49.515 --> 05:52.435
that was taken out by Master Seo Gyeong
a long time ago.

05:54.854 --> 05:56.606
You should give up on the search.

05:57.356 --> 06:00.068
If you let your curiosity about sorcery
consume you,

06:01.194 --> 06:06.115
that evil shall devour your entire soul
and you may lose everything that you have.

06:08.284 --> 06:09.744
Even if you want it undone,

06:10.912 --> 06:12.622
it will be impossible.

06:19.462 --> 06:22.256
I advise you to stop looking
for those who practice sorcery.

06:23.174 --> 06:25.426
You should know that the world
will not allow that…

06:26.469 --> 06:27.929
and will not forgive it.

06:34.936 --> 06:36.020
Just wait.

06:41.317 --> 06:42.360
Here.

06:48.032 --> 06:49.367
Did something happen to your hand?

06:50.076 --> 06:52.161
Correct. I am injured.

06:54.288 --> 06:56.541
I am injured even down to my soul.

07:08.678 --> 07:09.762
[sighs]

07:09.846 --> 07:11.597
Did some kind of sorcery do that to him?

07:14.934 --> 07:16.060
[sighs]

07:17.395 --> 07:19.564
[ominous music playing]

07:22.066 --> 07:23.276
[So-i sighs]

07:24.652 --> 07:27.280
[celestial music playing]

07:36.414 --> 07:37.665
[gasps]

07:43.004 --> 07:44.130
Oh, Bu-yeon.

07:45.548 --> 07:46.716
Bu-yeon.

07:47.842 --> 07:50.636
[suspenseful music playing]

07:54.849 --> 07:56.350
[Ho-gyeong sobs]

07:56.434 --> 07:58.144
[ominous music playing]

08:08.196 --> 08:10.615
[Mu-deok] I feel like our eyes just met.

08:12.366 --> 08:14.952
[So-i] Oh. I'm very sorry.

08:15.036 --> 08:17.163
Could I ask you to pick up my cane for me?

08:18.080 --> 08:20.917
[Mu-deok] It is the girl I ran into
in front of the house.

08:21.834 --> 08:23.461
[Ho-gyeong weeping]

08:23.544 --> 08:25.588
[breathing shakily]

08:28.841 --> 08:29.717
[chuckles]

08:39.018 --> 08:40.311
[Cho-yeon] Mother.

08:45.983 --> 08:46.943
Oh. Mother.

08:48.319 --> 08:49.695
Can this girl really be Bu-yeon?

08:50.613 --> 08:53.032
Yes, it's your sister.

08:54.116 --> 08:55.076
Bu-yeon.

08:55.743 --> 08:57.537
[Cho-yeon sobbing]

09:00.957 --> 09:03.918
Bu-yeon. Let's go to your room now.

09:36.033 --> 09:38.786
You are Jang Uk's maidservant.

09:39.787 --> 09:41.872
What are you doing over here at this hour?

09:42.623 --> 09:47.128
Oh. To help Young Lady Jin
run away in the night to be with her love,

09:47.211 --> 09:49.714
but it seems I'm not needed.

09:49.797 --> 09:51.299
I will be on my way right now.

10:02.143 --> 10:03.769
[So-i] What is Mu-deok doing here?

10:04.353 --> 10:06.188
I'm certain she did not recognize me.

10:07.315 --> 10:09.108
So should I have killed her then?

10:10.610 --> 10:13.779
Bu-yeon, I have kept your room
just as it always was.

10:14.530 --> 10:17.825
Because I believed that this day
would finally come.

10:29.170 --> 10:30.338
Let us go in.

10:33.299 --> 10:35.843
[soft music playing]

10:47.605 --> 10:49.857
Everything is just as it used to be.

10:50.900 --> 10:52.443
All of your things are here.

10:53.527 --> 10:56.322
Since I woke up
after almost dying in the lake,

10:57.698 --> 11:01.369
I have been barely scraping by
without even a proper place to sleep.

11:02.119 --> 11:03.996
I didn't know I had a room.

11:07.416 --> 11:10.211
And that I had a mother
who was waiting for me all this time.

11:10.961 --> 11:12.380
[So-i breathes shakily]

11:13.047 --> 11:17.176
I lived a life so miserable
that I wanted to die every day.

11:18.969 --> 11:21.389
[Ho-gyeong breathes deeply]

11:22.390 --> 11:23.808
Oh, my poor girl.

11:25.226 --> 11:27.603
I'll make sure you're happy every day.

11:29.021 --> 11:30.439
So do not worry now.

11:34.318 --> 11:35.486
Oh, Mother.

11:51.877 --> 11:55.923
[Jin] Is it true that Jin Mu really found
Ho-gyeong's daughter?

11:58.426 --> 12:01.512
Yes, they say the girl
opened the doors at Jinyowon.

12:02.555 --> 12:04.473
- What?
- [Heo Yeom] She opened the door?

12:04.557 --> 12:07.935
That door, it cannot just be opened
with some kind of trickery.

12:08.018 --> 12:11.439
They can only be opened by those
who have the blood of the Jin family.

12:12.106 --> 12:13.482
[exclaims]

12:14.483 --> 12:19.113
So has Bu-yeon
really come back to her alive?

12:21.907 --> 12:24.243
[pensive music playing]

12:28.706 --> 12:32.418
Why do my eyes hurt so much
every time I go to Jinyowon?

12:39.467 --> 12:42.094
[Mu-deok] Is it because
the relics are too powerful?

12:47.016 --> 12:49.268
[indistinct background chatter]

12:51.604 --> 12:54.482
[gentle music playing]

13:01.197 --> 13:02.740
What are you doing here?

13:03.949 --> 13:05.659
Huh? What's up with the mirror?

13:07.703 --> 13:08.704
[Jang Uk sighs]

13:09.705 --> 13:11.165
Trying to look pretty
for your young master?

13:12.416 --> 13:13.792
Don't talk nonsense.

13:14.752 --> 13:17.463
Hang on, hang on, hang on.
Maybe I want to look pretty.

13:17.546 --> 13:19.507
[sucks teeth]
Pick something

13:19.590 --> 13:21.842
that will look really nice
on your young master.

13:23.844 --> 13:25.304
I'll do it then.

13:28.265 --> 13:29.350
Hmm.

13:30.184 --> 13:33.020
- Am I pretty?
- Yes!

13:33.103 --> 13:34.855
That looks great on you.

13:35.397 --> 13:37.525
It would be weirder if it did not, huh?

13:38.692 --> 13:39.818
Let us just see.

13:41.195 --> 13:43.531
[gasps]
This looks good too.

13:43.614 --> 13:45.491
Well, I don't know.
Everything looks good on me.

13:46.742 --> 13:47.785
[chuckles]

13:47.868 --> 13:49.328
[Jang Uk laughs]

13:51.038 --> 13:52.790
What is this for?

13:52.873 --> 13:55.918
Give that to me.
And I will make you look so pretty.

13:57.962 --> 13:59.255
[Jang Uk] Mm.

13:59.338 --> 14:00.923
[laughs]

14:01.006 --> 14:05.094
Oh. So pretty.
You are so pretty I might just die.

14:06.095 --> 14:07.972
It seems your young master
has become pretty enough.

14:08.055 --> 14:09.598
And now, it's your turn.

14:15.187 --> 14:17.064
Wow, you are so pretty, Mu-deok.

14:17.147 --> 14:19.066
[cackles]

14:19.149 --> 14:22.319
How childish.
You said only my eyes were pretty.

14:22.403 --> 14:24.947
I did. I was sure
only your eyes were pretty.

14:26.323 --> 14:28.909
Did the poison you gave me
do something to my eyes?

14:28.993 --> 14:30.828
Now it's every part of you.

14:40.838 --> 14:44.466
You seem to be trying hard
not to love your young master so much.

14:44.550 --> 14:45.551
It seems tough on you.

14:50.055 --> 14:52.349
It is not… at all.

14:56.520 --> 14:58.022
You should have better control
of your blushing,

14:58.105 --> 14:59.565
if you're going to lie
right in front of me.

14:59.648 --> 15:02.109
Your face is bright red right now.
[chuckles]

15:03.319 --> 15:04.778
[groans]

15:04.862 --> 15:07.823
That is because you put so much rouge
on my face.

15:07.907 --> 15:09.033
Let me see. Let me see.

15:10.075 --> 15:11.201
[Jang Uk] Hmm.

15:11.785 --> 15:14.163
Oops, did I put it too much?
It's not coming off.

15:17.291 --> 15:18.500
You look like a…

15:19.376 --> 15:22.129
drunken dog. A little bit.

15:22.713 --> 15:25.424
[Jang Uk laughs]
Huh?

15:25.507 --> 15:28.802
Ah, don't look at me with those eyes.
You look like you really wanna bite me.

15:28.886 --> 15:31.221
- Maybe I really should bite you!
- Hey.

15:33.432 --> 15:35.643
I will not bite you. Come here.

15:38.812 --> 15:40.814
I know, I know, I know. I'm sorry.

15:44.944 --> 15:47.279
I bought something useless because of you.

15:48.364 --> 15:51.408
Just leave it in your room
if you don't want it. Maybe I'll use it.

15:53.243 --> 15:54.870
[Jang Uk] Hmm. This is pretty too.

15:56.163 --> 15:57.915
["Breath" by Kim Na Young playing]

16:56.598 --> 16:57.766
Oh, Mu-deok…

17:05.232 --> 17:07.860
["Breath" continues playing]

17:15.075 --> 17:16.702
You were almost run over.

17:26.170 --> 17:27.546
Mu-deok.

17:27.629 --> 17:30.674
Are you really drunk right now?
You drank without me?

17:33.385 --> 17:36.263
I had a drink as well.
Shall we get drunk together?

17:37.014 --> 17:38.307
I'm not drunk.

17:39.641 --> 17:40.976
But were you drinking though?

17:41.060 --> 17:43.854
Just a sip of liquor from someone
that I met at Gaema Village.

17:44.438 --> 17:46.815
Gaema Village.
Did you meet Shaman Choi there?

17:48.317 --> 17:50.778
I found evidence of a connection
to Jin Mu.

17:50.861 --> 17:53.697
But also, I saw the Crown Prince there.

17:54.448 --> 17:55.532
Crown Prince?

17:55.616 --> 17:59.036
Just like us. He… he's suspicious
of Jin Mu and the Queen.

18:00.204 --> 18:02.206
[foreboding music playing]

18:06.835 --> 18:07.878
[Eunuch Oh] Your Royal Highness.

18:09.296 --> 18:11.090
Did you visit Gaema Village?

18:12.174 --> 18:13.092
I did.

18:13.675 --> 18:14.760
The streets were so complicated.

18:14.843 --> 18:16.720
I struggled to find my way back
to the palace.

18:17.221 --> 18:18.222
Why?

18:18.764 --> 18:19.681
Did something happen?

18:19.765 --> 18:21.683
Jin Mu, the Assistant Gwanju,
is waiting here.

18:42.496 --> 18:46.208
[Jin Mu] Where did you go…
without any guards?

18:47.209 --> 18:50.420
I am embarrassed I was caught out
enjoying myself. Do not ask.

18:51.463 --> 18:52.756
[Jin Mu chuckles softly]

18:52.840 --> 18:54.842
So I've just met with the King.

18:55.551 --> 18:57.511
He was just talking about
the King's Star again.

18:57.594 --> 18:58.762
[exasperated sigh]

18:59.429 --> 19:00.848
If he's so worried,

19:00.931 --> 19:03.517
just make a fake constellation plate
that has the King's Star

19:03.600 --> 19:04.560
and then give it to him.

19:04.643 --> 19:06.979
Then, you would have to find every child
born on that day

19:07.062 --> 19:08.564
and kill all of them.

19:10.274 --> 19:11.483
Why would that be?

19:11.984 --> 19:13.902
They might be a hero
who's able to save the world

19:13.986 --> 19:16.905
like Master Seo Gyeong and not a rebel
who's seeking the throne.

19:16.989 --> 19:19.491
They say he saved the world
by getting rid of the ice stone.

19:19.575 --> 19:20.534
But he didn't.

19:21.827 --> 19:24.830
By not allowing anyone else access
to that power,

19:24.913 --> 19:26.915
Seo Gyeong dominated the world.

19:27.457 --> 19:30.252
The ice stone has a dangerous power
that attracts sorcery.

19:30.335 --> 19:32.504
Well, that is the reasoning
Songrim has claimed.

19:33.130 --> 19:36.884
Except the ice stone also has the power
to turn the mortal into the immortal.

19:38.093 --> 19:39.595
Instead of dying old and ugly,

19:39.678 --> 19:43.348
the ice stone can let you live
as your young and beautiful self again.

19:43.432 --> 19:45.142
The alchemy of souls?

19:45.225 --> 19:47.144
It is sorcery prohibited by Songrim.

19:47.227 --> 19:48.770
But if restrictions were overturned

19:48.854 --> 19:50.772
and the power of the ice stone
was established,

19:50.856 --> 19:51.940
then, sire,

19:52.733 --> 19:54.443
what do you think would happen?

19:57.863 --> 20:00.741
Those who have gained the ice stone
will then become immortal.

20:02.534 --> 20:05.662
But is it not dangerous if anyone
could wield such a power?

20:05.746 --> 20:07.623
Then we must not let just anyone use it.

20:07.706 --> 20:10.459
We must reinforce a new order
in which only the chosen,

20:10.542 --> 20:12.794
like Your Royal Highness,
can use the stone.

20:12.878 --> 20:15.297
[tense music playing]

20:15.380 --> 20:16.548
[sighs]

20:16.632 --> 20:18.467
The things you speak of

20:18.550 --> 20:21.261
will only be possible
if the ice stone emerges once again.

20:21.345 --> 20:24.640
I heard the lost daughter of Jinyowon
has returned alive.

20:24.723 --> 20:26.725
- Jinyowon?
- The one who found

20:26.808 --> 20:31.021
the ice stone for Seo Gyeong very long ago
was the first leader of Jinyowon.

20:31.104 --> 20:32.689
Jin Bu-yeon, who has just returned,

20:32.773 --> 20:35.192
had as much divine power
as the first leader.

20:40.030 --> 20:42.950
If the ice stone emerged again
like it did 200 years ago,

20:43.033 --> 20:44.868
the priestess of Jinyowon…

20:46.078 --> 20:48.121
would be able to find it, couldn't she?

20:52.084 --> 20:54.795
[Mu-deok] The eldest daughter of Jinyowon
has come back alive.

20:54.878 --> 20:57.506
She seemed like an ordinary girl
who could not see.

20:58.465 --> 21:00.425
I heard she was a great priestess.

21:00.509 --> 21:02.511
[inhales deeply]
Did she lose her powers?

21:02.594 --> 21:03.971
Perhaps.

21:04.054 --> 21:06.932
That is why she could not find
her way home for ten years.

21:08.976 --> 21:09.893
[Jang Uk sighs]

21:09.977 --> 21:13.563
It is Jin Mu who brought her.
It's unlikely she was ordinary.

21:13.647 --> 21:15.232
Was there anything suspicious?

21:16.900 --> 21:18.151
[sucks teeth]

21:18.652 --> 21:21.363
I know that I once saw her
in front of the house.

21:23.365 --> 21:26.118
[Mu-deok] I remember because I picked up
her cane for her.

21:28.412 --> 21:29.746
She was in front of our house?

21:29.830 --> 21:32.082
At the time I noticed nothing strange.

21:32.165 --> 21:33.792
Or today, for that matter.

21:35.836 --> 21:36.920
[Jang Uk exhales deeply]

21:37.587 --> 21:38.547
Except…

21:42.259 --> 21:44.261
she was using an umbrella as a cane.

21:44.344 --> 21:46.263
And I think I have seen
that umbrella before.

21:46.847 --> 21:49.725
She what? What is so special
about an umbrella though?

21:49.808 --> 21:50.851
No. No.

21:50.934 --> 21:53.729
It was a limited edition made
with sheepskin and bamboo.

21:54.521 --> 21:56.023
It was very expensive.

21:57.232 --> 21:59.484
- So then, why does she have it?
- What?

21:59.568 --> 22:01.320
Who else is supposed to have it, then?

22:03.530 --> 22:04.448
[Seo Yul] The umbrella?

22:05.032 --> 22:06.825
I'm afraid I don't have it anymore.

22:07.409 --> 22:08.869
I gave it to someone else.

22:08.952 --> 22:10.287
Who did you give it to and when?

22:10.370 --> 22:12.789
Oh. I did not mean to give it.

22:12.873 --> 22:15.250
I'm sorry. I know you bought it for me.

22:15.334 --> 22:17.252
No need to be sorry.

22:17.336 --> 22:19.338
You… you gave it to a girl?

22:19.963 --> 22:21.965
Yes, I did give it to a girl.

22:22.049 --> 22:23.050
Don't get angry, okay?

22:23.967 --> 22:25.927
[sighs]
I-- Why would I get angry?

22:27.137 --> 22:28.555
Which girl did you give it to?

22:29.139 --> 22:30.140
[Mu-deok] Hmm?

22:30.223 --> 22:32.684
Say something already, will you? Come on.

22:32.768 --> 22:34.603
Tell me which girl was it!

22:38.106 --> 22:39.649
Mu-deok. Mu-deok.

22:39.733 --> 22:41.276
You cannot ask him like that.

22:41.359 --> 22:42.903
Yul is, uh…

22:43.528 --> 22:45.739
Take a look at how pale he is right now.

22:45.822 --> 22:48.116
You're not interrogating
some cheating husband.

22:48.200 --> 22:50.869
"Which girl was it?"
That… that is not right.

22:51.703 --> 22:53.538
[Jang Uk] Watch me. Yul.

22:53.622 --> 22:56.500
Did you give it
to a girl who cannot see anything?

22:57.250 --> 22:58.251
How did you know that?

22:58.335 --> 22:59.461
[sighs]

22:59.544 --> 23:02.506
By chance, was the girl you met So-i?

23:03.799 --> 23:05.967
It was. Yes, I gave it to her.

23:06.051 --> 23:07.177
[Seo Yul] What about it?

23:08.220 --> 23:09.471
At Jinyowon, today,

23:10.347 --> 23:12.474
I saw Jin Bu-yeon, who is alive.

23:12.557 --> 23:14.142
She cannot see

23:14.226 --> 23:16.478
and was using that same umbrella
instead of a cane.

23:17.395 --> 23:18.563
And it was that umbrella?

23:18.647 --> 23:21.525
[tense stinger plays]

23:22.109 --> 23:22.984
[Dang-gu] Hey guys.

23:23.068 --> 23:24.152
[Dang-gu chuckles]

23:24.236 --> 23:25.862
You guys. Have you heard?

23:25.946 --> 23:29.241
They found the older sister.
They really found Jin Bu-yeon.

23:31.034 --> 23:32.077
[Dang-gu] Huh?

23:32.786 --> 23:34.538
What's up with you, guys?

23:35.122 --> 23:36.581
What were you talking about?

23:36.665 --> 23:39.084
We were talking about that girl So-i.

23:39.835 --> 23:40.669
So-i?

23:41.711 --> 23:42.921
Uh, that swindler?

23:43.505 --> 23:44.464
They found her?

23:44.548 --> 23:46.842
The Jin Bu-yeon that Jin Mu has found…

23:47.717 --> 23:48.927
is really So-i.

23:49.886 --> 23:51.596
I think they killed all of those people

23:51.680 --> 23:53.765
in order to hide her true identity.

23:55.392 --> 23:57.144
[tense music playing]

24:01.064 --> 24:01.982
[sighs]

24:09.447 --> 24:10.532
Jin Bu-yeon.

24:14.536 --> 24:16.955
I will turn myself into you perfectly.

24:34.556 --> 24:36.933
This is the same one Mu-deok had.

24:40.103 --> 24:41.771
Why is it in this room though?

24:43.690 --> 24:45.400
- [Ho-gyeong] Bu-yeon.
- [gasps]

24:45.483 --> 24:46.860
[door opens]

24:51.072 --> 24:52.032
[Ho-gyeong gasps]

24:52.991 --> 24:54.159
The eye mask.

24:55.285 --> 24:56.328
Remember it?

25:01.082 --> 25:02.125
[chuckles softly]

25:03.543 --> 25:05.587
I used to make all

25:05.670 --> 25:08.924
of your eye masks
by embroidering them myself.

25:09.674 --> 25:11.176
I would always make sure

25:11.259 --> 25:14.888
that you wore an eye mask
with the emblem of Jinyowon on it

25:14.971 --> 25:19.309
when you went outside
in case you ran into any trouble.

25:21.853 --> 25:23.104
Did you really?

25:23.730 --> 25:25.023
[ominous music playing]

25:26.358 --> 25:27.400
[So-i] Oh.

25:27.484 --> 25:29.569
It is old, but it's still silk.

25:30.362 --> 25:33.073
I think your birth parents
actually might be very rich.

25:35.575 --> 25:37.577
But can you truly not see anything?

25:38.495 --> 25:40.705
How is it that you can find rivers
so easily

25:40.789 --> 25:42.707
when even I cannot find them
and I can see.

25:45.335 --> 25:50.006
[Ho-gyeong] Bu-yeon, you have always
been able to feel energy.

25:50.715 --> 25:54.803
You could find things
and navigate your way around

25:55.387 --> 25:58.223
even better than those who see.

25:59.516 --> 26:01.685
[So-i] Mu-deok was from Sari Village too.

26:01.768 --> 26:04.312
Good at finding things and navigating.

26:05.063 --> 26:07.065
Even on the day you disappeared,

26:08.525 --> 26:11.361
you wore this eye mask. That was why…

26:12.529 --> 26:16.241
I was hopeful that you would find your way

26:17.367 --> 26:18.702
back to us with this.

26:19.828 --> 26:21.371
[So-i] The thing she treasured,

26:21.454 --> 26:24.708
saying it was the only clue she had
to finding her parents.

26:26.459 --> 26:28.545
If only you had this on you,

26:29.629 --> 26:32.799
I could have recognized you right away.

26:33.800 --> 26:37.262
[So-i] The eye mask I stole from Mu-deok
was made by this woman.

26:38.388 --> 26:39.306
Anyhow,

26:40.056 --> 26:43.852
thank you for coming back to me alive,
Bu-yeon.

26:50.734 --> 26:53.445
[So-i] The real daughter of this woman,
Jin Bu-yeon,

26:54.070 --> 26:56.656
is the Mu-deok that I know.

26:57.866 --> 26:59.951
[So-i whimpering]

27:19.220 --> 27:20.430
[gasps]
Bu-yeon.

27:23.141 --> 27:26.728
[So-i] Did this door also open
because of Mu-deok?

27:28.980 --> 27:30.523
Mu-deok is the real one.

27:32.025 --> 27:34.569
What will become of me
if she finds out about this?

27:37.322 --> 27:38.782
Will this lead to death?

27:42.035 --> 27:43.161
[whimpers]

27:44.746 --> 27:45.997
[Cho-yeon] Bu-yeon.

27:47.207 --> 27:48.500
What are you doing here?

27:49.376 --> 27:50.794
Trying to open the door again?

27:50.877 --> 27:52.045
Oh, no.

27:55.173 --> 27:58.385
I just can't believe
that I'm the daughter of this family.

27:58.468 --> 28:01.137
[chuckles] Oh, don't worry.

28:01.805 --> 28:02.972
It's true.

28:03.056 --> 28:05.975
Everybody saw you opening the door,
which proves it.

28:09.646 --> 28:13.650
But, Cho-yeon, that girl
who was next to you yesterday…

28:13.733 --> 28:14.943
Mu-deok?

28:15.026 --> 28:17.070
[scoffs]
She's not from Jinyowon.

28:17.153 --> 28:19.906
It seemed like Mother knew her.
Does she visit here often?

28:19.989 --> 28:22.200
Oh, Mother doesn't like her.

28:22.283 --> 28:24.369
She caused us a lot of trouble before.

28:24.452 --> 28:25.745
Oh, really?

28:28.039 --> 28:29.374
Must be

28:29.457 --> 28:31.459
why I felt negative energy from her.

28:32.502 --> 28:34.963
Negative… How?

28:35.046 --> 28:38.967
Dark and ominous energy was emanating
from that girl named Mu-deok.

28:39.843 --> 28:42.846
Best that you do not get too close
to someone with an aura like that.

28:43.430 --> 28:46.558
She's not that bad of a person, or is she?

28:47.642 --> 28:48.977
[U-tak] There you both are.

28:49.060 --> 28:50.478
[U-tak chuckling]

28:51.146 --> 28:52.147
Hi, Father.

28:52.230 --> 28:53.148
Hi, Father.

28:53.982 --> 28:55.692
Cho-yeon, your mother needs you.

28:56.276 --> 28:57.360
She needs me?

28:58.361 --> 29:00.864
[sighs]
I thought she wasn't angry anymore.

29:01.614 --> 29:03.366
[sighs]
I have to go now.

29:03.450 --> 29:04.743
Hmm. Go on.

29:09.748 --> 29:12.292
I'm sure I warned you
not to get too close to my daughter.

29:13.042 --> 29:14.169
I apologize.

29:15.295 --> 29:17.297
We're supposed to leave very soon,

29:17.380 --> 29:19.674
- so get ready and wait.
- Yes.

29:21.092 --> 29:22.343
But, wait, Father.

29:24.304 --> 29:25.889
[gasps]
My lord.

29:28.767 --> 29:31.227
Are you absolutely sure
that the real Jin Bu-yeon is dead?

29:32.687 --> 29:35.106
I worry about what might happen to me
if she's gonna return alive.

29:36.357 --> 29:38.318
There is no need to worry.

29:40.737 --> 29:41.905
She is dead.

29:47.368 --> 29:49.329
[breathing heavily]

29:51.456 --> 29:53.458
[So-i] Even if Mu-deok
is the real daughter,

29:53.541 --> 29:54.876
there's no one who would know.

29:56.377 --> 29:57.712
I will not get caught.

29:58.671 --> 30:00.006
[breathes deeply]

30:01.674 --> 30:03.134
I am Jin Bu-yeon.

30:15.313 --> 30:16.898
I thought about it all night.

30:17.524 --> 30:19.818
Even if I will lose my love,

30:19.901 --> 30:23.404
I have to do my duty as heir to Songrim.

30:23.488 --> 30:26.032
- I must go tell my uncle.
- No, wait.

30:26.115 --> 30:29.410
You saw the leader and Lady Jin
fighting the other day, did you not?

30:29.994 --> 30:31.287
If we accuse her long-lost daughter

30:31.371 --> 30:34.415
of being a fake and a murderer
without any concrete evidence,

30:34.499 --> 30:36.751
it could lead to a bloodshed
between Songrim and Jinyowon.

30:36.835 --> 30:38.002
[Dang-gu sighs]

30:38.086 --> 30:39.087
[Dang-gu] You're right.

30:39.170 --> 30:40.255
This is something

30:40.797 --> 30:43.091
that will result in a big fight if known.

30:43.633 --> 30:46.261
It wouldn't be right for Songrim
to be stuck in the middle.

30:48.221 --> 30:52.600
But I don't understand why they would
pretend the swindler is a great priestess?

30:52.684 --> 30:54.936
I guess they need someone
to become that great priestess.

30:55.687 --> 30:56.813
[Dang-gu] What if she's caught?

30:56.896 --> 30:58.898
How would a mother not know
her own daughter?

30:58.982 --> 31:02.402
They will be caught.
Oh, this is so reckless.

31:03.194 --> 31:04.946
Because it does not matter
if they get caught.

31:07.198 --> 31:08.783
[Jang Uk] Jin Mu has a card in his hand

31:08.867 --> 31:11.661
so big that even if Jin Ho-gyeong
finds out…

31:12.954 --> 31:14.372
she then can do nothing.

31:22.672 --> 31:24.841
[Ho-gyeong] She is definitely different.

31:24.924 --> 31:27.886
The scar from when she was young
and the mole behind her ear

31:27.969 --> 31:29.721
they are both like Bu-yeon.

31:31.180 --> 31:32.765
But her ears…

31:34.517 --> 31:37.896
The shape of the ears
does not change as one gets older.

31:39.480 --> 31:41.274
Am I misremembering it?

31:43.610 --> 31:44.652
[Jin Mu] Sister.

31:45.737 --> 31:48.615
[ominous music playing]

32:02.712 --> 32:04.589
In exchange for finding Bu-yeon,

32:05.131 --> 32:08.426
I did not think you'd merely ask
to see the inside of Jinyowon.

32:08.927 --> 32:11.721
Well, it was a place
that was completely forbidden to me,

32:11.804 --> 32:13.973
even as a part of the Jin family.

32:14.057 --> 32:16.517
I used to punish you very harshly

32:17.060 --> 32:18.895
if you even came near this place.

32:20.647 --> 32:22.523
I was too heartless all this time.

32:23.274 --> 32:25.944
Father had you with another woman
and I hated you,

32:26.027 --> 32:28.404
and I hated you
trying to read people's feelings

32:28.488 --> 32:30.406
and please others.

32:31.157 --> 32:32.241
I am sorry.

32:36.496 --> 32:38.164
It is all in the past now.

32:56.099 --> 32:57.684
Now that Bu-yeon is back,

33:00.979 --> 33:03.982
you should hurry along
with the succession.

33:05.692 --> 33:09.946
You think I should pass the title
to Bu-yeon?

33:10.029 --> 33:13.533
Well, having a new master
will also blow a new life into Jinyowon.

33:13.616 --> 33:15.743
And soon after that, we can

33:15.827 --> 33:19.831
finally push ahead with Cho-yeon's
marriage to the Crown Prince.

33:24.043 --> 33:25.420
We should not rush.

33:25.503 --> 33:27.714
Bu-yeon has not fully recovered
her memories,

33:28.423 --> 33:30.883
and I am still in good health.

33:30.967 --> 33:35.513
You cannot recover the ice stone
with just your powers alone.

33:37.765 --> 33:39.892
In order to save Bu-yeon
while you were pregnant,

33:39.976 --> 33:42.687
you took the ice stone
that was sealed within Jinyowon

33:43.521 --> 33:44.856
and gave it to Jang Gang.

33:47.108 --> 33:49.652
But how do you know that?

33:49.736 --> 33:50.945
Do not be surprised.

33:51.029 --> 33:53.322
I have no intention
to expose your mistakes.

33:54.657 --> 33:57.285
Jang Gang did not return
the ice stone to you,

33:57.368 --> 33:59.328
then claimed that
he would seal it away elsewhere.

34:00.246 --> 34:02.874
Do you know where the ice stone
that Jang Gang took

34:02.957 --> 34:04.625
from Jinyowon is right now?

34:04.709 --> 34:06.419
Now that the heir to Jinyowon is back,

34:06.502 --> 34:10.631
I shall also return the ice stone
rightfully to Jinyowon.

34:11.758 --> 34:14.177
So then, Jin Mu, you are--

34:14.260 --> 34:15.178
[Jin Mu] Sister.

34:15.261 --> 34:17.346
Did I not just say I would give it back?

34:17.847 --> 34:19.807
Do not be doubtful of all of this.

34:19.891 --> 34:22.602
Consider it a gift,
alongside your daughter.

34:22.685 --> 34:26.481
And just…
accept both these gifts gratefully.

34:31.819 --> 34:34.280
[ominous music playing]

34:45.875 --> 34:48.211
In other words, if I want this gift,

34:48.795 --> 34:52.799
I should also just accept Bu-yeon
without question as well.

34:52.882 --> 34:54.967
If you let down your guard
and stop doubting,

34:55.051 --> 34:56.094
then you can have it all.

34:57.428 --> 35:00.848
Both the ice stone Jinyowon lost
and your long-lost daughter.

35:02.558 --> 35:04.185
What is it that you want?

35:08.314 --> 35:10.733
You, as the leader of Jinyowon,
must fight Songrim,

35:11.359 --> 35:13.486
so that we can protect the ice stone.

35:15.196 --> 35:17.573
We would fight Songrim?

35:17.657 --> 35:19.325
Because if Songrim falls,

35:20.326 --> 35:23.746
we shall become the keepers
of the ice stone's mighty power.

35:40.555 --> 35:42.140
[Go Won] The alchemy of souls?

35:42.640 --> 35:44.600
It is sorcery prohibited by Songrim.

35:45.935 --> 35:47.728
But if restrictions were overturned

35:47.812 --> 35:49.522
and the power of the ice stone
was allowed established,

35:49.605 --> 35:50.648
then, sire,

35:51.482 --> 35:53.317
what do you think would happen?

35:56.195 --> 35:57.738
We would gain immortality.

36:04.745 --> 36:07.165
[Jin] Has the petrification stopped?

36:07.248 --> 36:09.584
He is breathing properly now,

36:09.667 --> 36:12.628
and moving his toes and fingers.

36:13.546 --> 36:16.257
Then how did such an experienced mage

36:16.841 --> 36:19.051
succumb to the temptations of sorcery?

36:19.135 --> 36:22.471
Well, if Jin Mu tempted me
by telling me he could move me

36:22.555 --> 36:25.224
into a young, beautiful body,
I might fall for it too.

36:25.933 --> 36:26.893
[Heo Yeom chuckles]

36:27.393 --> 36:31.314
I only jest. However, there are plenty
of people who would be convinced.

36:31.397 --> 36:32.899
They just can't do it

36:32.982 --> 36:35.151
because they are wary of Songrim.
[chuckles]

36:36.485 --> 36:38.779
Cheonbugwan, the palace,

36:39.488 --> 36:40.948
and now, Jinyowon too.

36:41.490 --> 36:43.534
Jin Mu controls all these places.

36:43.618 --> 36:44.994
[Heo Yeom] Still, are we not

36:45.077 --> 36:48.414
hot on the trail of that man's
alchemy of souls? Hmm?

36:48.497 --> 36:51.334
So, once Master Kang can speak,

36:51.417 --> 36:53.127
we'll get that bastard in our grasp.

36:53.711 --> 36:55.463
He is unafraid of being caught

36:56.589 --> 36:58.382
and already making another move.

36:59.842 --> 37:01.928
I'm even more afraid because

37:02.595 --> 37:05.056
I just do not know the extent of what…

37:06.515 --> 37:07.975
Jin Mu is planning.

37:09.810 --> 37:12.230
[ominous music playing]

37:15.775 --> 37:19.195
What is it you think that we are
going to do at Cheonbugwan today?

37:19.278 --> 37:22.323
Will it be painful? Something like
having another worm put inside me?

37:22.406 --> 37:25.159
All that you have to do
is do what you are told.

37:26.369 --> 37:29.622
You'll stand in front of many people,
so mind your actions.

37:32.250 --> 37:34.377
[dark music playing]

37:54.939 --> 37:59.235
Today, I shall reveal to you
the true Danju…

38:00.778 --> 38:02.697
who had been kept hidden until now.

38:07.201 --> 38:11.664
So step forward and show them your face.

38:12.498 --> 38:14.500
[celestial music playing]

38:29.598 --> 38:32.310
[Jin Mu]
Our Danju is Daeho's greatest priestess,

38:32.393 --> 38:35.896
Jinyowon's future leader,
Jin Bu-yeon is here.

38:38.274 --> 38:40.484
So please pay your respects to the Danju.

38:55.833 --> 38:58.878
[queen] After using that child to bring
the ice stone out into the world,

39:00.046 --> 39:01.922
I will shift into that body.

39:02.590 --> 39:05.634
In that case, I shall serve you
from close by…

39:06.802 --> 39:08.054
sister.

39:22.610 --> 39:26.572
The leader of Jinyowon has called
for a meeting of the Unanimous Assembly

39:26.655 --> 39:28.657
- without consulting Songrim?
- [Sang-ho] Yes.

39:28.741 --> 39:29.909
She has contacted each family,

39:29.992 --> 39:31.952
and they're all on their way
to Songrim now.

39:32.036 --> 39:34.288
[ominous music playing]

39:35.748 --> 39:40.252
What is Jinyowon up to this time
to cause such a stir with everything?

39:45.132 --> 39:47.176
Hmm, that woman is

39:47.259 --> 39:50.179
the mother of the young man
now lying in Sejukwon.

39:53.808 --> 39:55.935
Why is everyone suddenly rushing in?

39:56.977 --> 40:00.398
[Dang-gu] Apparently, Jinyowon called for
the Unanimous Assembly to gather.

40:03.109 --> 40:04.527
It's Young Lady Jin.

40:05.277 --> 40:07.905
Is that blind woman Jin Bu-yeon?

40:09.031 --> 40:09.990
So-i?

40:11.283 --> 40:12.201
Yes.

40:15.579 --> 40:17.248
[Jang Uk] They are moving faster
than I expected.

40:17.331 --> 40:19.834
It seems they're trying to use
the fake daughter they made

40:19.917 --> 40:21.544
to do something today.

40:30.010 --> 40:32.346
It appears that girl is Jin Bu-yeon.

41:00.541 --> 41:02.960
The leader of Jinyowon has requested

41:03.043 --> 41:06.338
that the royal family participate
in the next Unanimous Assembly.

41:06.422 --> 41:08.048
The Unanimous Assembly?

41:08.841 --> 41:09.842
[sighs]

41:09.925 --> 41:11.010
What is this about?

41:11.093 --> 41:13.012
She has said she will announce

41:13.095 --> 41:16.056
very important matter
that will decide the fate of Daeho.

41:18.058 --> 41:19.852
[suspenseful music playing]

41:25.357 --> 41:28.861
Not long ago, with the emergence
of the assassin, Naksu,

41:28.944 --> 41:30.988
there has been a lot of talk
in the capital

41:31.071 --> 41:32.698
about soul-shifting incidents.

41:33.491 --> 41:37.328
Hence, why we of Jinyowon strove
to aid Songrim in every way we could

41:37.411 --> 41:39.622
in their search for the origin
of the sorcery.

41:40.372 --> 41:41.332
Except…

41:42.875 --> 41:47.505
perhaps they considered Jinyowon's
cooperation as obedience because Songrim

41:47.588 --> 41:49.715
arrogantly and disrespectfully

41:49.798 --> 41:51.634
began making unreasonable demands.

41:53.719 --> 41:55.971
[Ho-gyeong] Under the pretext
of cracking down on sorcery,

41:56.055 --> 41:58.641
they forced their way
into not only Cheonbugwan

41:58.724 --> 42:00.392
but Jinyowon as well.

42:00.476 --> 42:03.896
As if they thought all mages
were sorcerers,

42:03.979 --> 42:05.814
they then sought to investigate

42:05.898 --> 42:08.734
all the mage families using our relics.

42:09.276 --> 42:10.528
- [all muttering]
- [mage 1] Absurd.

42:10.611 --> 42:15.658
They even brought a relic of Jinyowon
right into the royal palace.

42:15.741 --> 42:18.244
Are you saying Songrim suspected us?

42:18.327 --> 42:19.662
[mage 2] That is completely over the line.

42:19.745 --> 42:22.623
- [mage 3] Songrim is going too far.
- [mage 4] I can't believe this.

42:23.249 --> 42:25.376
[Jin] Did you call for this meeting

42:25.459 --> 42:28.587
of the Unanimous Assembly just to air
your complaints with us, Lady Jin?

42:28.671 --> 42:29.630
[Ho-gyeong] Behold.

42:29.713 --> 42:32.007
Songrim cannot stand me
speaking against them

42:32.091 --> 42:33.968
and is trying to silence me.

42:34.552 --> 42:36.595
I, the leader of Jinyowon,

42:36.679 --> 42:38.013
have called this meeting

42:38.097 --> 42:41.433
to break the restriction on Jinyowon
for the past 200 years

42:41.517 --> 42:44.144
in order to stop Songrim's autocratic

42:44.228 --> 42:49.191
and absolute actions that were carried out
using sorcery as an excuse.

42:52.945 --> 42:53.862
Bu-yeon.

42:53.946 --> 42:56.282
[ominous music playing]

43:04.164 --> 43:08.627
This child is the heir to Jinyowon
and after ten years,

43:08.711 --> 43:10.087
Bu-yeon's returned.

43:10.170 --> 43:12.965
[suspenseful music playing]

43:13.674 --> 43:16.385
So that is the daughter
I heard they found.

43:20.014 --> 43:23.183
Through my daughter,
who will lead Jinyowon after me,

43:23.267 --> 43:26.270
there's something
I have to present to you all.

43:37.781 --> 43:41.118
The ice stone, which is the source
of the alchemy of souls

43:41.201 --> 43:45.539
and the very thing Songrim
has been harassing mages about

43:45.623 --> 43:47.333
was inside Jinyowon.

43:47.416 --> 43:49.668
[suspenseful music intensifies]

44:01.138 --> 44:03.349
[indistinct chatter]

44:08.062 --> 44:11.023
[enigmatic music playing]

44:35.214 --> 44:36.924
[Mu-deok] So this was Jin Mu's plan.

44:37.675 --> 44:40.969
To use Jinyowon to bring the ice stone
back out into the world.

44:41.053 --> 44:42.554
This might not be the end of it.

44:43.472 --> 44:47.101
With one side compromised,
they will move to the other side.

44:49.853 --> 44:51.021
What do you mean?

44:51.647 --> 44:52.648
Don't you see?

44:53.232 --> 44:55.943
He handed the ice stone
the Queen had to Jinyowon.

44:56.026 --> 44:58.904
He will move the soul of the shaman
inside the Queen's body

44:58.987 --> 45:00.781
over to Jinyowon as well.

45:03.951 --> 45:05.828
She'll abandon the Queen's body…

45:07.663 --> 45:11.625
and move into the girl's body
who will become the leader of Jinyowon.

45:12.668 --> 45:14.128
The alchemy of souls.

45:16.672 --> 45:17.714
[sighs]

45:18.757 --> 45:21.009
[tense music rises]

45:27.141 --> 45:28.851
[man] The Unanimous Assembly

45:29.560 --> 45:33.522
is holding a meeting regarding
the soul shifter incidents, right?

45:33.605 --> 45:35.315
Mm-hmm. Or so I hear.

45:36.442 --> 45:39.278
Do not buy useless jewelry.
You should buy gold only.

45:39.361 --> 45:41.864
During unstable times,
you can only rely on gold.

45:41.947 --> 45:44.783
I imagine we will be very busy
once the assembly ends.

45:44.867 --> 45:45.701
I suppose.

45:45.784 --> 45:48.203
When it is over,
everyone will come for a drink

45:48.287 --> 45:50.956
- and sit around cursing Songrim.
- [man] Hey.

45:51.039 --> 45:53.083
Stop touching things
if you're not going to buy them.

45:53.167 --> 45:56.170
I'm sorry. Oh, will you just wait
for a minute?

45:56.253 --> 45:57.963
- [woman 1] I want all of them.
- [woman 2] Pass me that one.

45:58.046 --> 46:00.299
- [woman 3] This one?
- [woman 2] Yes, I want to see it.

46:04.470 --> 46:07.055
The capital is just buzzing with the news

46:07.139 --> 46:08.932
of the Unanimous Assembly.

46:09.933 --> 46:13.145
With all this commotion,
I imagine he will come.

46:14.605 --> 46:16.356
Do you mean our Gwanju Jang Gang?

46:17.483 --> 46:19.526
I thought that it was very strange

46:19.610 --> 46:23.655
that Young Master Park just kept
bringing up the Gwanju Jang Gang.

46:23.739 --> 46:27.284
The leader of Songrim also seemed
to be anticipating the Gwanju's arrival.

46:28.452 --> 46:30.162
[breathes deeply]

46:34.875 --> 46:38.420
Keep this with you
and pass it on to him if he comes here.

46:39.379 --> 46:40.464
What is it?

46:41.298 --> 46:42.424
May I take a look?

46:43.258 --> 46:44.343
[maid Kim gasps]

46:53.310 --> 46:54.228
It's blank.

46:54.311 --> 46:58.649
Is it perhaps like the Words of the Heart
that was written using a spell?

46:59.525 --> 47:00.609
[scoffs]

47:00.692 --> 47:04.238
When Jang Gang reads that paper,
he will do exactly as is written there.

47:05.364 --> 47:07.991
[brooding music playing]

47:10.661 --> 47:15.040
Also, is it all right if you don't attend
the Unanimous Assembly?

47:15.123 --> 47:17.626
I am a direct pupil of Master Seo Gyeong.

47:19.211 --> 47:20.796
Even if I attend it,

47:20.879 --> 47:25.842
I cannot acknowledge my master's actions
nor can I deny any of them.

47:31.932 --> 47:33.392
[mage 1] Are you saying that

47:33.475 --> 47:36.144
Master Seo Gyeong
left behind an ice stone?

47:36.228 --> 47:38.605
I thought he got rid of them all.

47:38.689 --> 47:40.399
Did Songrim know of this as well?

47:40.482 --> 47:42.734
[mage 2]
Then everything that Songrim has done

47:42.818 --> 47:45.779
claiming it was Seo Gyeong's will
is deception.

47:45.862 --> 47:48.365
- Deception?
- [mage 1] It is deception.

47:48.448 --> 47:50.409
How many mage families
has Songrim cracked down on

47:50.492 --> 47:52.995
under the pretext of only wanting
to stop sorcery?

47:53.078 --> 47:54.288
Is this not so?

47:54.371 --> 47:56.623
- [mage 3] Indeed.
- [mage 4] Quite right.

47:56.707 --> 47:58.625
[mage 5] Has Songrim been deceiving us?

47:58.709 --> 48:00.043
Have we all been fooled by Songrim?

48:00.127 --> 48:02.921
- [mage 6] That's what I'd like to know.
- Everyone, please, calm down.

48:04.047 --> 48:05.257
Songrim was

48:05.340 --> 48:09.219
unaware that an ice stone still remained
within Jinyowon.

48:09.803 --> 48:11.972
[mage 1] I do not want to
hear Songrim's excuses.

48:12.055 --> 48:13.390
We gathered here

48:13.473 --> 48:17.311
must discuss what to do with the ice stone
that Master Seo Gyeong has left behind.

48:17.394 --> 48:20.439
Seo Gyeong wanted to
destroy the origin of sorcery

48:20.939 --> 48:22.816
and that origin is the ice stone.

48:23.567 --> 48:25.068
With everyone watching here,

48:25.902 --> 48:28.071
we must destroy this ice stone.

48:28.572 --> 48:31.408
It was also his will
to leave the ice stone in Jinyowon.

48:31.491 --> 48:33.827
If we follow his will,
it should stay in Jinyowon.

48:33.910 --> 48:35.495
No, if that is your stance,

48:35.579 --> 48:37.706
you should not have brought it out here
in the first place.

48:37.789 --> 48:39.791
Are you asking Songrim to just do nothing

48:39.875 --> 48:41.293
after telling us you have an ice stone?

48:41.376 --> 48:44.171
What is your plan?
To just make fools of Songrim?

48:44.254 --> 48:47.049
What is the leader of Jinyowon said
that is incorrect?

48:47.132 --> 48:49.217
She just asked to follow
Master Seo Gyeong's will

48:49.301 --> 48:50.719
and keep the ice stone in Jinyowon.

48:50.802 --> 48:53.889
Songrim no longer has the right
to interfere

48:53.972 --> 48:55.515
with matters of the ice stone.

48:55.599 --> 48:59.353
Why, you little… Now you will not even
respect Songrim's position, huh?

48:59.436 --> 49:02.356
We are here to discuss
how to use the ice stone

49:02.439 --> 49:04.441
according to the will
of Master Seo Gyeong.

49:04.524 --> 49:06.902
If Songrim doesn't wish to do that,
leave the assembly.

49:06.985 --> 49:08.612
- [mage 1] Quite right.
- [mage 2] Hear, hear.

49:08.695 --> 49:10.947
[mage 3] Songrim has deceived us
all this time, so they should leave.

49:11.031 --> 49:13.700
- [mage 1] Of course, they must leave.
- [mage 2] Leave!

49:13.784 --> 49:14.993
[mage 1] If you do not like it, leave.

49:15.077 --> 49:16.662
- [mage 5] Leave, Songrim.
- [mage 6] Leave.

49:16.745 --> 49:18.914
- [man 7] Get out of here.
- [Jin] So this is why

49:18.997 --> 49:22.250
you unveiled the ice stone,
Jin Mu, you snake.

49:22.334 --> 49:25.253
Now that Songrim's reasoning
has fall into pieces,

49:25.337 --> 49:27.089
no one will listen to them.

49:30.384 --> 49:32.052
[breathes deeply]

49:34.763 --> 49:36.098
[mouthing]

49:36.682 --> 49:37.933
[mage 1] If Songrim

49:38.016 --> 49:40.644
insists on opposing Jinyowon
keeping the ice stone,

49:41.186 --> 49:44.231
perhaps it would be better
for a third party to take it.

49:45.190 --> 49:46.566
I would like to suggest

49:46.650 --> 49:48.568
that I take it back to Gisan with me.

49:48.652 --> 49:50.278
- [man 3 scoffs]
- Just like that?

49:50.862 --> 49:52.948
Why would Gisan take the ice stone

49:53.031 --> 49:55.742
- with no magical ability?
- [mage 1] Magical ability?

49:55.826 --> 49:58.620
You know Gisan has absolutely no right
to the ice stone.

49:58.704 --> 50:00.622
- [mage 5] Who would agree to that?
- No right?

50:00.706 --> 50:03.166
Gisan has the longest line of mages
in Daeho.

50:03.250 --> 50:06.753
And that gives us enough right
to keep the ice stone if we want it.

50:06.837 --> 50:08.380
How dare you?

50:09.005 --> 50:12.259
- Are you challenging me?
- I would love to see you try.

50:12.342 --> 50:14.177
- [mage 6] Who are you to insert yourself?
- [mage 1] Watch your tongue.

50:14.261 --> 50:16.763
- Unbelievable. How dare you?
- Then what else do you expect me to say?

50:16.847 --> 50:18.890
Someone needs to put this little man
in his place.

50:18.974 --> 50:20.434
- [Heo Yeom] All right.
- Little man?

50:20.517 --> 50:21.935
- All right, stop, stop, stop, stop.
- Little man? You bastard.

50:22.018 --> 50:23.770
- [mage 1] I'll show you how big I am.
- [grunts]

50:24.980 --> 50:26.398
[gasps]

50:26.940 --> 50:29.109
Did you just hit me? Huh?

50:29.192 --> 50:31.236
[Heo Yeom] You old man. You!

50:32.696 --> 50:34.281
- You…
- Hey. Hey.

50:34.364 --> 50:37.451
- How dare you, you old geezer?
- [grunting]

50:37.534 --> 50:39.453
[thrilling music playing]

50:40.912 --> 50:42.080
[mage 1] You are gathering energy?

50:42.164 --> 50:44.416
All right. Gather it all up
and throw it at me.

50:44.499 --> 50:46.501
- [mage 2] Oh, my.
- Come on now.

50:46.585 --> 50:47.586
- Come on.
- [Heo Yeom] Do you…

50:47.669 --> 50:49.796
Do you think I will not throw it? Huh?

50:49.880 --> 50:51.256
You act just like you look.

50:51.339 --> 50:53.341
Oh, really? Look who is talking.

50:54.176 --> 50:56.428
[Yun-ok] Grandfather
is at the Unanimous Assembly?

50:56.511 --> 50:57.345
[Seo] Yes.

50:57.929 --> 51:00.140
I have not been able to find
the medical book

51:00.223 --> 51:01.683
you asked me to locate yet.

51:01.767 --> 51:03.935
I can find it in Jeongjingak myself.

51:05.145 --> 51:07.314
That assembly seems like quite a big deal.

51:07.397 --> 51:10.275
It seems like all the mages who always
guards Sejukwon have gone there as well.

51:14.196 --> 51:17.699
Apparently, my precious son
is still alive in there.

51:40.055 --> 51:41.807
[weeping]

51:42.891 --> 51:43.975
Ji-ho.

51:46.436 --> 51:48.188
[melancholy music playing]

51:57.656 --> 51:58.865
[gasps]

52:00.242 --> 52:02.118
Oh. [whimpering]

52:02.994 --> 52:04.329
I knew you were alive.

52:04.412 --> 52:06.456
[sobbing]

52:11.503 --> 52:12.963
[gasps]

52:13.046 --> 52:14.089
Ji-ho.

52:14.172 --> 52:15.924
[breathing heavily]

52:16.883 --> 52:18.301
[eerie music playing]

52:18.385 --> 52:19.636
Huh?

52:20.929 --> 52:22.055
[scoffs]

52:23.890 --> 52:25.141
[groans, choking]

52:26.810 --> 52:28.353
[choking]

52:31.731 --> 52:33.400
[all clamoring]

52:41.074 --> 52:43.159
Enough, all of you. Be seated.

52:43.243 --> 52:45.328
[all clamoring]

52:46.580 --> 52:50.959
It would be best for Jin Ho-gyeong
to step in now and wrap things up.

52:52.460 --> 52:54.045
How dare you touch him?

53:00.176 --> 53:03.263
Enough of this. Come on, mages.

53:03.346 --> 53:05.557
All right. This is not over.

53:05.640 --> 53:08.184
[all clamoring]

53:08.268 --> 53:09.811
[mage] Consider yourself lucky.

53:10.604 --> 53:11.479
[Ho-gyeong] Please, listen.

53:12.689 --> 53:14.608
After hearing everyone's thoughts,

53:14.691 --> 53:16.735
it seems that it is the consensus

53:16.818 --> 53:20.780
for all to be able to use the ice stone
left by the Master.

53:21.990 --> 53:23.074
As such,

53:23.158 --> 53:27.704
I, the leader of Jinyowon,
would like to pose a question to you all.

53:27.787 --> 53:31.166
I would like to suggest that from now on,

53:31.833 --> 53:35.754
the Unanimous Assembly be held
at Jinyowon.

53:36.504 --> 53:38.632
[ominous music playing]

53:38.715 --> 53:40.216
[all muttering]

53:40.300 --> 53:43.511
If there are no objections
from the mages here today,

53:43.595 --> 53:45.430
let us end today's meeting right here

53:45.513 --> 53:49.100
and continue these talks not at Songrim

53:49.976 --> 53:52.520
but at Jinyowon, its new location.

53:54.731 --> 53:56.566
[all muttering]

53:58.234 --> 53:59.736
I consider everyone in agreement

53:59.819 --> 54:01.571
and will be ending today's meeting
right now.

54:03.448 --> 54:06.826
We shall continue
to store this ice stone in Jinyowon.

54:08.036 --> 54:09.579
If we are to prevent strife,

54:10.497 --> 54:14.542
then the ice stone must be destroyed
in front of everyone right now.

54:14.626 --> 54:17.087
Tell me why that would be
for Songrim to decide

54:17.170 --> 54:18.505
when no one here agrees?

54:18.588 --> 54:21.633
The alchemy of souls is occurring,
that means

54:21.716 --> 54:24.094
the soul ejector used for that purpose
came from that ice stone.

54:24.177 --> 54:26.304
Along with Cheonbugwan
and the royal palace,

54:26.388 --> 54:28.723
you now suspect Jinyowon as well?

54:30.308 --> 54:33.603
We cannot end the assembly now like this.

54:35.146 --> 54:36.314
Lady Jin,

54:36.398 --> 54:42.404
you may not remove the ice stone
from the premises of Songrim.

54:42.487 --> 54:45.615
Does Songrim plan to oppose
the will of everyone here?

54:45.699 --> 54:46.783
No one here…

54:48.243 --> 54:50.620
may remove the ice stone
from this premises.

54:52.038 --> 54:54.457
[suspenseful music playing]

54:59.796 --> 55:01.214
If you wish to leave…

55:02.632 --> 55:04.843
you must fight us.

55:08.805 --> 55:10.890
It will turn into a war.

55:19.149 --> 55:20.859
[Go Won] The situation is dire.

55:20.942 --> 55:22.777
Should you not step in, Your Majesty?

55:23.486 --> 55:25.822
It's exactly as Master Lee said.

55:25.905 --> 55:28.616
The fights never ended
because everyone coveted it.

55:28.700 --> 55:30.285
And that is why it was banned.

55:32.245 --> 55:34.247
[Sun] They are now fighting
over the ice stone.

55:34.831 --> 55:36.041
So just as Master Lee said,

55:36.124 --> 55:38.460
the King's Star has probably emerged now.

55:39.544 --> 55:41.129
[Go Won sighs]

55:41.212 --> 55:43.006
[drum beating]

55:59.773 --> 56:01.858
[tense music playing]

56:13.661 --> 56:16.331
[epic music playing]

56:23.338 --> 56:25.965
I see that all my former masters
are gathered here.

56:26.758 --> 56:29.594
As your former pupil, Jang Uk,
I offer my greetings.

56:30.553 --> 56:32.305
[mage 2] Who is that young man?

56:32.388 --> 56:33.640
[mage 1] It is Jang Uk.

56:33.723 --> 56:36.518
The failure of the Jang family,
who trained under me for a time.

56:37.393 --> 56:39.813
He has trained under your family as well,
has he not?

56:39.896 --> 56:42.857
[sighs]
He was the one who ran after three days.

56:42.941 --> 56:46.069
I apologize for beating the drum
and interrupting all of your fun

56:46.653 --> 56:49.405
as you ran around,
snapping at each other like dogs.

56:52.158 --> 56:54.911
- What should we…
- Just leave him.

56:55.495 --> 56:58.540
He stopped them,
whatever his method may be.

56:59.249 --> 57:00.875
Jang Gang son, Jang Uk.

57:02.961 --> 57:06.047
I hope that you have a good reason
to be as disrespectful

57:06.131 --> 57:08.383
as you dare to be
in front of the royal family.

57:12.637 --> 57:15.014
I have come here to convey
Master Seo Gyeong's will.

57:15.515 --> 57:17.767
[tense music playing]

57:26.359 --> 57:28.653
I have been dropping hints
as to the Master's will,

57:28.736 --> 57:30.488
but do not know
if they will take the bait.

57:36.578 --> 57:40.206
I speak on behalf of Master Lee Cheol,
the direct pupil of Master Seo Gyeong.

57:40.290 --> 57:42.584
So I ask the mages
of the Unanimous Assembly,

57:42.667 --> 57:44.586
show your respects to the Master's will.

57:53.219 --> 57:55.305
According to Master Lee Cheol,

57:55.388 --> 57:57.849
all of Master Seo Gyeong's thoughts
on the ice stone

57:57.932 --> 57:59.642
are recorded in the Words of the Heart.

58:02.145 --> 58:04.272
Since he put the reason
he left in ice stone

58:04.355 --> 58:07.192
in the Words of the Heart
for every Jeongjingak's mage to read,

58:07.275 --> 58:10.487
Songrim didn't try to hide anything
about it at all.

58:13.615 --> 58:17.118
Most of you gathered here
have read Words of the Heart.

58:17.619 --> 58:21.331
He told me to find his will
in the Words of the Heart.

58:24.167 --> 58:25.835
Do you remember
what the Words of the Heart says?

58:25.919 --> 58:28.129
No, it's been a while.

58:28.671 --> 58:30.340
So you mean that the ledger

58:30.423 --> 58:32.467
explains why he had to leave an ice stone?

58:34.260 --> 58:35.345
Yes.

58:35.428 --> 58:39.015
Since everyone insist that we follow
the will of Master Seo Gyeong,

58:39.098 --> 58:41.559
we must argue that the contents
of the Words of the Heart

58:41.643 --> 58:43.895
and not over this ice stone right here.

58:43.978 --> 58:47.106
Where is Master Seo Gyeong's
Words of the Heart which he speaks of?

58:47.815 --> 58:49.609
It was kept at Songrim

58:49.692 --> 58:53.571
until it was recently sent over
to Jinyowon at Master Lee's request.

58:55.281 --> 58:57.867
Yes, Jinyowon. It is being kept there.

58:57.951 --> 59:00.078
Then go and bring
the Words of the Heart here.

59:02.205 --> 59:03.373
Yes.

59:11.798 --> 59:13.466
Jin Cho-yeon of Jinyowon.

59:14.259 --> 59:16.135
I shall go and retrieve
the Words of the Heart.

59:16.219 --> 59:18.555
Since it originally belonged to Songrim,

59:18.638 --> 59:20.807
I would like to send a member
to go with her.

59:21.558 --> 59:23.726
Park Dang-gu, accompany her.

59:30.024 --> 59:31.192
Let's go.

59:42.453 --> 59:44.289
[Jang Uk breathes deeply]

59:47.083 --> 59:48.209
I just…

59:49.127 --> 59:52.880
Well, it has been decades since I myself
read the Words of the Heart.

59:52.964 --> 59:55.091
What is written in there now?

59:55.174 --> 59:58.094
- Nothing but a very short poem.
- [Heo Yeom sucks teeth]

59:58.595 --> 01:00:01.014
Did Jang Uk just lie to everyone?

01:00:01.097 --> 01:00:03.224
There is no mention of the ice stone,

01:00:03.933 --> 01:00:08.021
so I do not know what he is thinking
by bringing up the Words of the Heart.

01:00:11.065 --> 01:00:13.568
What is actually written
in the Words of the Heart?

01:00:13.651 --> 01:00:15.028
I do not know.

01:00:16.112 --> 01:00:20.366
He is probably lying in order to buy time.

01:00:20.450 --> 01:00:22.744
But Master Seo Gyeong did leave it,
did he not?

01:00:23.453 --> 01:00:26.164
What if the cause
that we just barely crushed

01:00:26.247 --> 01:00:28.583
is validated by that book?

01:00:31.210 --> 01:00:34.464
It looks like to me like the people
over there are very angry.

01:00:34.547 --> 01:00:36.758
Next time, we'll surprise them as well.

01:00:37.592 --> 01:00:38.801
And for that,

01:00:39.802 --> 01:00:41.054
we will then need him.

01:00:53.816 --> 01:00:55.818
It still just looks like a poem.

01:00:57.111 --> 01:00:58.988
Does it have a deeper meaning?

01:01:00.365 --> 01:01:01.449
I don't know.

01:01:02.617 --> 01:01:04.869
[Dang-gu]
He probably just used it as an excuse.

01:01:05.912 --> 01:01:07.664
If he's trying to stall for time,

01:01:08.373 --> 01:01:10.166
we should make our way back slowly.

01:01:10.833 --> 01:01:11.793
Let us hurry.

01:01:12.460 --> 01:01:13.628
Oh, uh, I…

01:01:13.711 --> 01:01:16.547
I'm so hungry. Is there anything to eat?

01:01:17.632 --> 01:01:19.342
I haven't had breakfast.

01:01:20.009 --> 01:01:23.262
Are you trying to stall
for time right now? For Songrim's sake?

01:01:23.971 --> 01:01:26.265
[breathes deeply]

01:01:26.349 --> 01:01:29.268
And so, you think we should hurry back
to the fighting?

01:01:29.352 --> 01:01:31.396
I have no time to argue with you.

01:01:31.479 --> 01:01:32.980
My mother and sister are waiting.

01:01:33.815 --> 01:01:35.274
Young Lady Jin.

01:01:36.818 --> 01:01:38.319
So your sister…

01:01:39.362 --> 01:01:41.197
do you believe it's really her?

01:01:42.865 --> 01:01:43.908
Why do you…

01:01:43.991 --> 01:01:49.288
You heard that the murders Mu-deok
was accused of were really

01:01:49.372 --> 01:01:52.041
committed by a girl named So-i, right?

01:01:53.543 --> 01:01:55.461
Your sister that they found…

01:01:56.838 --> 01:01:58.131
is actually So-i.

01:02:00.425 --> 01:02:01.592
What?

01:02:03.094 --> 01:02:05.096
[foreboding music playing]

01:02:20.903 --> 01:02:24.699
Did you tell Cho-yeon that girl
made you uncomfortable?

01:02:25.950 --> 01:02:27.326
Oh.

01:02:27.410 --> 01:02:28.536
Yes.

01:02:30.413 --> 01:02:32.498
Her energy is quite dark and ominous.

01:02:32.582 --> 01:02:35.126
I would prefer she not get close
to me again.

01:02:41.382 --> 01:02:43.801
I don't want anything
to trouble my daughter,

01:02:44.635 --> 01:02:45.928
so I'll get rid of her.

01:02:47.180 --> 01:02:48.222
[soft chuckle]

01:02:52.185 --> 01:02:53.770
Thank you so much, Mother.

01:03:21.547 --> 01:03:23.257
[Mu-deok] Something has changed.

01:03:24.217 --> 01:03:25.760
Does she know she is fake?

01:03:26.761 --> 01:03:29.222
Or is she using her despite knowing that?

01:03:31.057 --> 01:03:33.643
Why are you stalling
with the Words of the Heart, Jang Uk?

01:03:37.814 --> 01:03:40.817
DAILY LOG OF CHEONBUGWAN

01:03:43.528 --> 01:03:44.737
[Go Won] "May 1st."

01:03:44.821 --> 01:03:47.698
"While the Gwanju, Jang Gang,
had gone to Gaema Village himself

01:03:47.782 --> 01:03:48.825
in pursuit of Shaman Choi,

01:03:48.908 --> 01:03:51.244
a woman who has used curses
to harm others,

01:03:51.327 --> 01:03:52.787
she escaped in a fire

01:03:52.870 --> 01:03:54.622
and is presumed dead."

01:03:56.082 --> 01:03:58.501
What Shaman Bong in Gaema Village said,

01:03:58.584 --> 01:04:00.169
was really in the records.

01:04:00.753 --> 01:04:04.590
This must be when Shaman Choi
and Jin Mu of Cheonbugwan met.

01:04:04.674 --> 01:04:07.802
Why is that that you keep searching
for this Shaman Choi?

01:04:07.885 --> 01:04:11.305
Did you find the house Eunuch Kim
used to frequent in Gaema Village?

01:04:12.682 --> 01:04:14.016
Yes, I did.

01:04:14.517 --> 01:04:17.186
It was the apothecary he frequented.

01:04:17.270 --> 01:04:18.646
Apothecary?

01:04:19.272 --> 01:04:21.858
I just answered you,
now answer my question.

01:04:23.442 --> 01:04:24.610
Yes, Your Royal Highness,

01:04:25.444 --> 01:04:27.864
Eunuch Kim called the person
he served as Shaman Choi.

01:04:27.947 --> 01:04:29.448
[thrilling music playing]

01:04:31.951 --> 01:04:33.661
The person that Eunuch Kim served was…

01:04:33.744 --> 01:04:35.496
It was your mother, the Queen.

01:04:38.040 --> 01:04:40.167
[Jang Uk]
Have you not also been suspicious of her?

01:04:40.251 --> 01:04:43.129
The soul of the true Queen
is still alive somewhere.

01:04:43.963 --> 01:04:46.799
She must be where Eunuch Kim was going.

01:04:47.758 --> 01:04:49.594
How can you be sure she's still alive?

01:04:51.512 --> 01:04:53.514
[ominous music playing]

01:04:54.640 --> 01:04:57.101
Her Majesty's Lantern of Life
has not gone out.

01:04:57.184 --> 01:04:59.020
She is a member of the Seo family.

01:04:59.687 --> 01:05:01.022
[Jang Uk] I'll find the real Queen

01:05:01.105 --> 01:05:04.150
and expose the impostor
to all of the Unanimous Assembly.

01:05:09.155 --> 01:05:11.532
So you want to drag me
into your schemes of things?

01:05:11.616 --> 01:05:13.784
This also concerns your mother,
doesn't it?

01:05:19.498 --> 01:05:20.791
Once you expose her,

01:05:20.875 --> 01:05:23.002
what do you plan to do
about the ice stone?

01:05:23.085 --> 01:05:24.962
We follow the Master's will

01:05:25.046 --> 01:05:26.964
as it is written in Words of the Heart.

01:05:27.048 --> 01:05:27.924
[Seo Yul] Uk.

01:05:28.883 --> 01:05:31.093
The Words of the Heart
is not about the ice stone.

01:05:31.177 --> 01:05:34.805
Was that not just a lie you made up now
so you can circumvent the situation?

01:05:34.889 --> 01:05:36.223
It was not a lie.

01:05:36.933 --> 01:05:38.601
The reason that he

01:05:38.684 --> 01:05:41.729
left the ice stone is definitely written
inside the Words of the Heart.

01:05:43.356 --> 01:05:44.732
Oh.

01:05:46.776 --> 01:05:49.612
So the ice stone holds the power
of Hwansu.

01:05:49.695 --> 01:05:52.323
It can control water, fire, and wind,

01:05:52.406 --> 01:05:56.202
and it can even control the very souls
of human beings.

01:05:56.285 --> 01:05:57.370
That is why

01:05:57.453 --> 01:05:59.664
it's a power humans
must not be allowed to possess.

01:05:59.747 --> 01:06:03.042
It is hard to believe that what looks
like just a little chunk of ice

01:06:03.125 --> 01:06:04.293
can hold that much power.

01:06:04.377 --> 01:06:05.878
I must see it myself.

01:06:09.966 --> 01:06:12.760
Have any of the mages here
ever seen that power?

01:06:15.805 --> 01:06:19.433
Have you all been fighting over it
without witnessing what it does?

01:06:21.519 --> 01:06:22.436
[Sun] Ah.

01:06:22.520 --> 01:06:24.146
While we are gathered here,

01:06:25.272 --> 01:06:27.566
we can just verify the ice stone's power.

01:06:28.359 --> 01:06:30.403
And how do you intend to verify it?

01:06:30.486 --> 01:06:31.696
It controls souls, right?

01:06:32.405 --> 01:06:35.074
Then we can try bringing
a dead person to life.

01:06:36.575 --> 01:06:39.286
Hwansu isn't sorcery,
so it's not forbidden.

01:06:39.370 --> 01:06:41.080
And it's good that we'll save
someone's life.

01:06:42.832 --> 01:06:45.126
Lady Jin, since you brought the ice stone,

01:06:45.626 --> 01:06:47.086
try it here in front of us.

01:06:48.546 --> 01:06:49.880
But, sire,

01:06:49.964 --> 01:06:53.009
there's no dead person here
right now for me to save.

01:06:54.427 --> 01:06:56.053
Then we can kill someone.

01:06:56.137 --> 01:06:57.471
[cackles]

01:07:02.018 --> 01:07:02.893
You.

01:07:06.355 --> 01:07:08.524
You. Come over here.

01:07:10.818 --> 01:07:11.736
Yes.

01:07:17.074 --> 01:07:18.701
Kill her and bring her back.

01:07:19.285 --> 01:07:21.412
She is a servant who cannot cast spells.

01:07:21.495 --> 01:07:24.623
There's nothing to worry about
even if she's close to the ice stone.

01:07:24.707 --> 01:07:25.541
Your Majesty,

01:07:25.624 --> 01:07:28.002
how can you kill a person
just for your amusement?

01:07:28.085 --> 01:07:29.962
I'm trying to see her being saved…

01:07:30.546 --> 01:07:31.422
with this.

01:07:31.505 --> 01:07:33.549
You would ask such a terrifying thing

01:07:33.632 --> 01:07:35.926
of someone who is so young and helpless?

01:07:39.555 --> 01:07:40.639
You are…

01:07:41.724 --> 01:07:43.017
too afraid to do it?

01:07:46.562 --> 01:07:48.064
[Sun] I will give you 100 yang in gold.

01:07:48.773 --> 01:07:50.107
So will you do it?

01:07:53.486 --> 01:07:54.570
Yes.

01:07:55.362 --> 01:07:56.530
I will try to do it.

01:07:57.948 --> 01:07:59.075
I will show…

01:07:59.825 --> 01:08:03.746
the power that Your Majesty and all
of the mages of the Unanimous Assembly

01:08:04.455 --> 01:08:06.332
wish to see demonstrated.

01:08:34.693 --> 01:08:37.822
[Mu-deok] My chance to get my hands
on the ice stone has finally come.

01:08:39.240 --> 01:08:43.953
In order to get that chance,
first, I will have to die.

01:08:45.121 --> 01:08:50.292
Not a single person here cares
whether someone like me lives or dies.

01:08:50.376 --> 01:08:53.379
The only thing they feel
is the desire to see

01:08:53.462 --> 01:08:55.422
the power of the ice stone.

01:09:01.846 --> 01:09:03.889
[thrilling music playing]

01:09:15.818 --> 01:09:17.987
I do not know if I am about to die

01:09:18.737 --> 01:09:23.450
or whether I will regain my power
with the power of the ice stone.

01:09:23.534 --> 01:09:26.620
I have placed myself
at the edge of a cliff, alone,

01:09:26.704 --> 01:09:29.623
with nothing but the ice stone
in front of me.

01:09:29.707 --> 01:09:31.208
[Jang Uk] I missed you too. A lot.

01:09:34.503 --> 01:09:35.504
That's my response.

01:09:36.672 --> 01:09:40.467
[Mu-deok] I am glad you are not…
standing there with me.

01:09:41.260 --> 01:09:44.513
[Jang Uk] It describes his desire to save
someone who is precious to him.

01:09:44.597 --> 01:09:46.640
The Master's Words of the Heart

01:09:46.724 --> 01:09:49.143
was a letter he wrote to his dying lover.

01:09:49.226 --> 01:09:52.062
And he says he left something
because he can't bear to let her go.

01:09:52.146 --> 01:09:54.023
Are you trying to say that the hero

01:09:54.815 --> 01:09:57.234
who destroyed the ice stone
to save the world

01:09:57.318 --> 01:10:00.529
fell for the temptation of that power
to save just one person?

01:10:00.613 --> 01:10:02.698
Well, the foolish and grieving human heart

01:10:03.365 --> 01:10:05.993
wants to hold on
against the laws of heaven and earth.

01:10:06.785 --> 01:10:11.832
And that is the confession of love he left
in the Words of the Heart.

01:10:12.750 --> 01:10:14.251
[somber music playing]

01:10:16.712 --> 01:10:19.882
I do not like this situation either.

01:10:21.258 --> 01:10:23.636
So I will let you die now painlessly.

01:10:25.346 --> 01:10:28.140
Everyone's gathered here
to see me brought back to life,

01:10:28.974 --> 01:10:31.018
not to see me die, so, please…

01:10:34.647 --> 01:10:36.065
bring me back to life

01:10:37.107 --> 01:10:38.692
so they are not disappointed.

01:10:40.736 --> 01:10:42.446
I had better try not to disappoint.

01:10:45.616 --> 01:10:48.494
[So-i] The real mother
is killing her own daughter.

01:10:49.620 --> 01:10:52.706
[ominous music playing]

01:11:13.060 --> 01:11:14.478
[grunting]

01:11:24.780 --> 01:11:25.698
[groans]

01:11:44.383 --> 01:11:45.551
So pretty.

01:11:47.052 --> 01:11:48.846
My dear Bu-yeon.

01:11:48.929 --> 01:11:50.723
[tense music playing]

01:11:57.688 --> 01:11:58.814
Oh, Mother…

01:12:01.775 --> 01:12:04.320
[celestial music playing]

01:12:22.755 --> 01:12:24.840
- [thunder rumbles]
- [celestial music continues playing]

01:12:38.354 --> 01:12:41.690
["Scars Leave Beautiful Trace"
by Car, the garden playing]

01:12:58.332 --> 01:12:59.792
[Jang Uk] Something has gone wrong.

01:12:59.875 --> 01:13:01.377
Is something wrong with the ice stone?

01:13:01.460 --> 01:13:02.419
[man] When we approached the door,

01:13:02.503 --> 01:13:04.838
we were pushed back
by a great force of wind all of a sudden.

01:13:04.922 --> 01:13:06.632
[So-i] This is all happening
because of Mu-deok.

01:13:07.508 --> 01:13:09.134
Our dear children are in there.

01:13:09.218 --> 01:13:10.260
[Heo Yeom] Yun-ok!

01:13:10.344 --> 01:13:12.513
[Go Won] The energy I gathered
in the sword just spilled out.

01:13:12.596 --> 01:13:14.723
It seems like it is the barrier
rather than the sword.

01:13:14.807 --> 01:13:16.892
[Jin] What do you mean,
Master Kang has disappeared?

01:13:16.975 --> 01:13:17.851
[screams]

01:13:17.935 --> 01:13:19.686
[Go Won]
No one can cast spells in this place.

01:13:20.270 --> 01:13:21.522
How could a soul shifter do?

01:13:21.605 --> 01:13:23.357
[Jang Uk] We can't all die.

01:13:23.440 --> 01:13:25.442
So I'll lure him to the Secret Room
and lock him up.

01:13:25.526 --> 01:13:27.111
Uk is going to die.

01:13:27.653 --> 01:13:30.781
[Go Won] And if the door is locked,
that means he died inside.

01:13:32.491 --> 01:13:34.743
[Mu-deok] Jang Uk, my dear pupil.
